#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""saneui: every script of Sane UI under one command, by a name that says what it does (README.md, *Building*).

  saneui                          the commands, by group
  saneui <command> [args ...]     runs one: saneui installdev, saneui showerrors, saneui atlas status
  saneui start|pause|resume|stop|status <command>
                                  the ones that run in the background: saneui start gpurunner, saneui stop comfyui
  saneui help <command>           a command's own help

In the terminal: ~/bin/saneui is a link to this file (made once: saneui --link); the Konsole greeting shows the
main commands (saneui --card), fish completes the names (saneui --names).
"""
